000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RPTCTL.
000300* Control breaks, VIII 2.10 and 3.1.4(6): CONTROL FINAL, DEPT, ACCT;
000400* headings and footings at each level; the footings read the prior
000500* values of the controls; a footing's NEXT GROUP applies only at
000600* the level of the break; TERMINATE closes every level; footings
000700* may run past LAST DETAIL to FOOTING.
000800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001000 FILE-CONTROL.
001100     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-PROUT.
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 FILE SECTION.
001400 FD  PRINT-FILE
001500     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
001600     REPORT IS CTL-RPT.
001700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001800 01  WS-IDX   PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
001900 01  WS-LC    PIC ZZ9.
002000 01  WS-KEYS.
002100     05  WS-KEY   PIC X(4) OCCURS 8 TIMES.
002200 01  WS-REC.
002300     05  DEPT     PIC XX.
002400     05  ACCT     PIC 99.
002500 01  WS-AMT   PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
002600 REPORT SECTION.
002700 RD  CTL-RPT
002800     CONTROLS ARE FINAL DEPT ACCT
002900     PAGE LIMIT IS 14 LINES
003000     HEADING 1
003100     FIRST DETAIL 3
003200     LAST DETAIL 10
003300     FOOTING 12.
003400 01  PAGE-HEAD TYPE PH LINE 1.
003500     05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(11) VALUE 'CONTROL RPT'.
003600     05  COLUMN 20 PIC ZZ9   SOURCE PAGE-COUNTER.
003700 01  DEPT-HEAD TYPE CH DEPT LINE PLUS 1.
003800     05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(11) VALUE 'BEGIN DEPT '.
003900     05  COLUMN 12 PIC XX    SOURCE DEPT.
004000 01  ACCT-HEAD TYPE CONTROL HEADING ACCT LINE PLUS 1.
004100     05  COLUMN 3  PIC X(5)  VALUE 'ACCT '.
004200     05  COLUMN 8  PIC 99    SOURCE ACCT.
004300 01  DETAIL-LINE TYPE DE LINE PLUS 1.
004400     05  COLUMN 5  PIC XX    SOURCE DEPT.
004500     05  COLUMN 8  PIC 99    SOURCE ACCT.
004600     05  COLUMN 12 PIC ZZ9   SOURCE WS-AMT.
004700 01  ACCT-FOOT TYPE CF ACCT LINE PLUS 1 NEXT GROUP PLUS 1.
004800     05  COLUMN 3  PIC X(9)  VALUE 'END ACCT '.
004900     05  COLUMN 12 PIC 99    SOURCE ACCT.
005000     05  COLUMN 15 PIC X(3)  VALUE 'OF '.
005100     05  COLUMN 18 PIC XX    SOURCE DEPT.
005200 01  DEPT-FOOT TYPE CONTROL FOOTING DEPT LINE PLUS 1
005300     NEXT GROUP PLUS 2.
005400     05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(9)  VALUE 'END DEPT '.
005500     05  COLUMN 10 PIC XX    SOURCE DEPT.
005600 01  FINAL-FOOT TYPE CF FINAL LINE PLUS 1.
005700     05  COLUMN 1  PIC X(13) VALUE 'END OF REPORT'.
005800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005900 MAIN-PARA.
006000     MOVE 'AA01' TO WS-KEY (1).
006100     MOVE 'AA01' TO WS-KEY (2).
006200     MOVE 'AA02' TO WS-KEY (3).
006300     MOVE 'BB01' TO WS-KEY (4).
006400     MOVE 'BB03' TO WS-KEY (5).
006500     MOVE 'BB03' TO WS-KEY (6).
006600     MOVE 'BB03' TO WS-KEY (7).
006700     MOVE 'CC01' TO WS-KEY (8).
006800     OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
006900     INITIATE CTL-RPT.
007000     PERFORM ONE-REC VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1
007100         UNTIL WS-IDX > 8.
